{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】BANDAI SPIRITS「30 MINUTES LABEL」攤位報導！展示超時空要塞、鋼彈、偶像大師等高品質塑膠模型</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bfa053dd9e6b6f67ecd61f245567662f82246a2a4ed4520f40d2431cac40337c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe1a417687263d02de9d47a986750dc7e\"/><p>於2026年7月24日(五)至7月28日(二)舉辦的「 ACGHK 2026 」－「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026(香港動漫電玩節2026)」 本次為大家介紹推出多樣化塑膠模型的「 30 MINUTES LABEL 」攤位！</p><h3>BANDAI SPIRITS的塑膠模型齊聚一堂「30 MINUTES LABEL」攤位！</h3><p>「30 MINUTES LABEL」攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/47a7877ff71cdd28f0023aaf2b44c9cd823f0206d148c43fd22d404081680731/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1a5bc59abfd23b23895668299ebd3073\"/><p>「 30 MINUTES LABEL 」是以 忘卻時間享受30分鐘 為主題的BANDAI SPIRITS塑膠模型品牌。 目前以4個系列展開。</p><p>30 MINUTES MISSIONS</p><p>30 MINUTES SISTERS</p><p>30 MINUTES FANTASY</p><p>30 MINUTES PREFERENCE</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fda026fcedc5cbac41c6bffd56697993104a3d68c18d5de9a94654b30ea677f4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff9b85055a65578565ebd213b068cd118\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3d502a0c927a9e5ee2792a84dd23441bf862195f1179848c3eb63b2d41b16756/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8359cc8d1fe0dab8170558b1990e27bb\"/><p>在攤位入口處， 30 MINUTES FANTASY 的「里貝爾騎士」與 30 MINUTES MISSIONS 的 巨大塑膠模型 迎接來賓！</p><p>「超時空要塞」系列</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3bc4a00abe236e30f05841839f3ae3d40e1146e8fe37c39c76221cd35b570e0c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F20525a4958729aba31ecfd6dd7d6d428\"/><p>懷著興奮的心情走入內部，映入眼簾的是「超時空要塞」系列的展示！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/660affa2f90099b6a5cfb27091e9d7cd15f1508821d430298786fd02c60e362e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F44cf9e86a051332f1bc70b807055b0ce\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6163bb41cfef888c9d7a58ca71b47517e38a9a1e260ef0e0ca63ab9e56d53be6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F69d2b2d18c1160326b8b86d4f99f8b39\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34b50fea613626d45843ce83595af78655457a33ae1de8fc305193d8f992d816/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc82da7eabaf3f23271e2aa2c53b82ddd\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/70a3b3e0f70e0ee133f836d30ebd29cd63f71f297c60aefce510b0dfbceec0c0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8d6ab2067bffdde6f95293e8ffa29b45\"/><p>「超時空要塞Δ」的查克・馬斯坦古機、阿拉德・梅塔斯座機，以及「超時空要塞F」的彌賽亞女武神(早乙女有人機)。 精密的細節令人陶醉。</p><p>「鋼彈」系列</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1ca65764612a59668c0d5e75520a5960bb8da7546ecad7aa8b2c3a888275c9cb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1dac18c6f95b7c43684dc9e66b2530d9\"/><p>當然也有 鋼彈模型 專區。</p><p>「HG 1/144 斑豹高達」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/200498c3c0d65ed1d2ae51c8aaf1834f18f4eca060db6e274d8a844f7b1c2265/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe7cdf713659495739732ce6db4c8e896\"/><p>預定於 2026年8月8日(六) 發售的「HG 1/144 斑豹高達」 忠實再現了內藏手臂格林機槍的變形、與左臂的合體・收納、及各開閉機關！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3fa3a5581e53c89b17dc6295587c04670cc6c1658775bfb595d57804a74a9f6a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F63dabd9427514722117d7af2ea143f86\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7bebbb0e3d2668ec1ab9dfbd7dca8b6b611d154e48b6dc76a7fcf3c0cab7bca0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F48213afd8354c30148ce1fc59e0471b5\"/><p>「HG 1/144 沙漠高達改 EW」亦可裝備披風。</p><p>「HG New Keroro機器人」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e8f5880534988869ebd9832a040a027cb20084f70fadc71eeb4bf23dcc0849b0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4c1e1f25873e0035c2a06d436b28d47c\"/><p>自2006年「Keroro軍曹組裝模型收藏 Keroro機器人」發售以來時隔20年復活的「HG New Keroro機器人」</p><p>「RG 1/48 AV-98Plus 英格拉姆·Plus」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/30d851f56e825dc215b6f3b8241196380f1c5143a37cf0744b567fdc2e6aa3e1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8884756d1f5d208f9c421248a054e6f1\"/><p>「機動警察PATLABOR EZY」的最新商品「RG 1/48 AV-98Plus 英格拉姆·Plus」 「警視廳」字樣令人印象深刻。</p><p>並肩而坐</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cc8ad3427cc3b7b98622e0fa28623acf2c1e5f292f16f71a4e970448610f8dfe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1944430c01cab97ef71a3221aeb9b710\"/><p>來自「新世紀福音戰士」的綾波零與惣流・明日香・蘭格雷。 坐姿相當可愛。</p><p>LIVE中的姿態</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ce0e60fa965e003f93f89efcef5e016a508a465c719139e22aa4b7bbdcfac09f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb554074bd2bb538a35d548aa62acded4\"/><p>「孤獨搖滾！」的喜多郁代塑膠模型。 附屬了吉他和麥克風架。</p><p>30 MINUTES SISTERS</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c8f7fbac1249bc1b049822dc9a51154d01b5e9c68d0494257949af00ad806ee/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5f6410f634cff5189e9d24d0fd3fdbd6\"/><p>30 MINUTES SISTERS 兼具可愛與帥氣！</p><p>「偶像大師 閃耀色彩」聯名塑膠模型</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d39646a6a54155fb97ba34769a22688fa6d5765c51f545c2d8561f57fab191f8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F453e7c05f26a126b2e16a4f591376410\"/><p>與「偶像大師 閃耀色彩」聯名，全體偶像化身為塑膠模型。</p><p>櫻木真乃</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ac72ea64abb700676b08dbacc0a289c476db54ea9612dcab260abe1866397a12/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F13ed6a0a7106f2464ea5b67e4126fcfc\"/><p>彷彿隨時會開始歌唱的表情！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/16ed54d54507c5b0c9a3fbc5786eb4c7624d31ffff7b88a75c527ee02aab8349/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8cff5ff52308eb953ed2143f46aa0261\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/15d93c520ae60a398a49e0c3bcb6c3a7dc1539a475f23fdbc96111274e44dc68/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2c438bf9ec10cb2935e28bcc24f63e3b\"/><p>還有桌上遊戲的展示。</p><p>「PLAKORO」是使用骰子型寶可夢進行對戰的遊戲。 以模擬方式對戰也充滿新鮮感！</p><p>「GUNDAM ASSEMBLE」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f312e6ae12c865f99a48d32f69085809f18c81b16fd3b0040f73a7b920764d03/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffc2a65bbc3cffa557f5e734bf29d616c\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/953e82cabd7e41bc71c9a73858b5ab4ed1316ed05cdcbab515e63060f05bfe73/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F40dd9dc1f86ae491230b3c786e374aa9\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f52dad2ab3a8a85883d5604b6055f561f29eacb46b89a47cebec29db3c834a4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb6e6b7b31edcb4230a8fb25766849489\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d3b257fa962903b421ee385e92818fa5eac4c8b2ba2028aa057f9ba66e6e3125/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9b68e94206359280325737fd8fa13545\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/096c35ecb1b7f510933b9cd25727df2e783b7ef7427f1223ce5361327ef659bf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F19b1353d3e9e3822f02fcdd5c7ab3ad4\"/><p>「GUNDAM ASSEMBLE」是使用約5cm的機動戰士微型模型，在小型部隊中競爭戰術的 小型衝突戰 ，可享受其樂趣。</p><p>微型尺寸的渣古II</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/49c38249f7088024393d903d78fc7ccbcb7e801c13d6b720b65248908027d3f9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb86002d8f92ba277d60d278dbad77abe\"/><p>附屬的微型模型亦可依照喜好上色。 預定於 2026年10月 發售。</p><p>以上是撩動大人收藏魂的「30 MINUTES LABEL」攤位報導！</p><p>🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Animate」「Medialink」攤位報導！「第五人格」及「劇場版 CHIIKAWA 人魚島的秘密」展示 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「遊戲王」「TAKARA TOMY」攤位報導！卡牌遊戲體驗以至打卡熱點一應俱全 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「寶可夢集換式卡牌遊戲」「AEON信用卡」攤位報導！申辦AEON信用卡即可獲得PTCG卡包！？ 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「csl」攤位報導！體驗《漫威鬥魂》試玩，還有Galaxy最新智慧型手機登場 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Bushiroad」「Hot Toys」攤位直擊！TCG 體驗區、4.5 公尺巨大蜘蛛人吸睛登場</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T03:20:45.363781+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1613,"images":28,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}